  "mechanism": "Because lane pitch w and row pitch 2w lock, offset mod w selects whether strip centers sit near tree rows (one full 16-seg strip per row + sparse mid-gap leftovers) or midway so two adjacent strips each fully cover the same 16-tree row (24×16=384).",
  "conclusion": "【已验证】 w=4 航道数双峰（约 206–218 vs 恒为 384）的根因是 2w = 8 m = ha_orchard 名义行距 row_spacing：偏移相位决定「每行 1 条满载航带 + 行间稀疏条带」还是「每行被 2 条满载航带双覆盖」。高峰：offset≈w/2（CSV 1.86–2.15）时 24 条航带均含 16 段 → 24×16=384；低峰：offset≈0 或 ≈w（CSV 0 / 3.86–3.90）时仅约 12 条满载（对正树行）+ 行间抖动擦边稀疏段 → ~210。fixed_y_lanes 对无冠层相交的条带直接 skip；行间条带因 jitter 常仍有 1–5 段，故 strip_count 并非减半，减半的是满载段数。不改代码。",
  "conclusion_tag": "【已验证】",
  "planning_untouched": true
}